<title>USA: TABLE-Univest Corp Q2 net income rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Univest Corp Q2 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SOUDERTON, Pa. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNIVEST CORPORATION OF PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>Q2 ENDED		    Jun 30, 1997   Jun 30, 1996  % CHANGE</p>
<p> Net Interest Income	    10,280	    9,693     6.06%</p>
<p> Provision for Loan Loss	   370		215    72.09%</p>
<p> Net Interest after prov.	9,910	    9,478     4.56%</p>
<p> Net Income			  3,283	    3,047     7.75%</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		 0.85	     0.78     8.97%</p>
<p> 6 MONTHS ENDED	   Jun 30, 1997   Jun 30, 1996  % CHANGE</p>
<p> Net Interest Income	    20,054	   19,222     4.33%</p>
<p> Provision for Loan Loss	   580		530     9.43%</p>
<p>Net Interest Income After</p>
<p>  Provision for Loan Loss     19,474	   18,692     4.18%</p>
<p> Net Income			  6,296	    6,031     4.39%</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		 1.62	     1.54     5.19%</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
</text>
